1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,000
What if Sand stays? TrendTwin uses YouCam Apparel VTO to stress-test that decision across 1,800 virtual market futures.

2
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:30,000
We hold the collection constant and change one business decision at a time.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Three culturally specific virtual markets replace the generic average shopper.

4
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:15,000
YouCam generates the visual evidence. TrendTwin compares the control and counterfactual across city, skin tone, and trend cells.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Sand creates no defensible market and raises deadstock exposure in every launch city. Taipei-first survives the same test.

6
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:55,000
This is not a recommendation. It is a decision report: reject Sand, approve Taipei first, and move 18 percent of production budget to Sage.

7
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:00,000
One simulation prevented one expensive mistake.
